; Capability gpu: run programs on the GPU (Metal), e.g. Blender renders (docs/design/capabilities.md).
; The platform's base profile (seatbelt.py) "allows everything first, then blocks the dangerous parts", and Metal/IOKit
; are not on the deny list to begin with, so this fragment is empty: gpu here is an authorization (who may use the
; platform runner), not one more hole.
; If the base later becomes "deny everything by default, open item by item", the iokit-open / mach-lookup Metal needs
; go here.
